  "hole": 1,
  "name": "Banner Drive",
  "photo": "01.webp",
  "narrative": "Where the adventure begins\u2026 Formally elevated pallet tee box. Lots of festivity behind you. Lots of potential glory in front of you. Relatively flat fairway. Slightly breaks left. Need to be wary of the actual banner streaking diagonally across. Can be a difficult range to calibrate to off the bat with pre-round nerves. A fairly long distance to pin but very easy, especially with the dry October conditions, to blow by it. You're off n runnin!"
